                <pb facs="0955" n="851" xml:id="pg851"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/9389.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                            Germany to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-10-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 26, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s telegram October 24, 6 p.m. Germany will wait as requested.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
